@ Ravaged Path, the cave under Route 204 between its south and north parts.
@ Platinum's cave (rows 2-51 of its 32x64 chunk), drafted with mapkit's cave
@ style on Emerald's cave tileset. The south exit leads to the cave mouth in
@ Route 204's lower cliff, the east exit to the one on its middle plateau.
@ Rock Smash rocks across the corridor to the east exit, as in Platinum, mean
@ the way through needs Rock Smash. Most of the cave is
@ joined by water, so the north-east room and the shores along the channel
@ need Surf.
@ Platinum's LUCK INCENSE is an AMULET COIN here: this game has no Luck
@ Incense, and the Amulet Coin has the same held effect (double prize money).
